					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1150b23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεγρήγορα,</span> intr., <i>continue
